  "items": [
    {
      "order": 1,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_001.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "最近我在想“保持好奇心”，感觉背后不只是一个简单问题。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "对，这类问题通常同时涉及价值、资源和长期影响。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "如果只看眼前效率，可能会忽略别的东西。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "所以需要平衡，不是把一个指标做到最高就结束。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "我发现趋势很重要，但趋势也可能让人跟风。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "没错。趋势可以参考，判断还是要回到自己的目标。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "那选择工具或方案时，应该先看什么？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "先看问题本身，再看资源、成本和实际使用条件。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "有时候机会和风险会同时出现。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这很常见。成熟的策略不是消除所有风险，而是知道能承担多少。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "责任又该怎么分？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "谁做决定、谁掌握信息、谁承担后果，都应该说清楚。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "我以前常常把短期结果看得太重。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "长期来看，稳定的方法和可持续的节奏更有价值。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "如果信息不完整，还能做判断吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "可以，但要承认不确定性，也要准备根据新信息调整。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "这和“保持好奇心”特别相关。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "是，因为这里的影响可能比表面看到的更广。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_019.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "我们是不是也要考虑没有被直接听见的人？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_020.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "当然。做公共或团队选择时，这一点很重要。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_021.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "如果大家的价值判断不同呢？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_022.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "先找共同底线，再把分歧保留下来，不一定马上统一。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_023.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "听起来好的策略需要留出变化空间。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_024.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "对，过度确定反而可能让系统失去适应能力。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 25,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_025.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "那我想先列出目标、资源、风险和机会。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 26,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_026.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "再写下你最看重的价值，判断会更透明。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 27,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_027.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "我也想记录为什么做这个选择。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 28,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_028.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "很好。以后回看时，你能分清结果不好和判断过程不好。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 29,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_029.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "这样讨论以后，我对“保持好奇心”没有那么简单化了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 30,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_030.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这就是进步：不是答案更多，而是看问题的角度更完整。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 31,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_031.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "好，我们先按这个框架继续观察。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 32,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_line_032.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "可以，等有新信息时再更新判断。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 33,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_word_001.m4a",
      "type": "vocabulary",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "趋势",
      "emotion": "neutral"
    },
    {
      "order": 34,
