      "textZh": "所以需要平衡，不是把一个指标做到最高就结束。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 47,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_sentence_003.m4a",
      "type": "sentence",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "先看问题本身，再看资源、成本和实际使用条件。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 48,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_sentence_004.m4a",
      "type": "sentence",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "责任又该怎么分？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 49,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_sentence_005.m4a",
      "type": "sentence",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
