      "type": "sentence",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "是，因为这里的影响可能比表面看到的更广。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 51,
      "file": "hsk5_sc023_sentence_007.m4a",
      "type": "sentence",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "先找共同底线，再把分歧保留下来，不一定马上统一。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 52,
